---
title: Agent lifecycle
---
flowchart TD
  click pool href "crates/uze-workspace/src/checkout.rs"
  place([An agent is placed]) --> where{In place or isolated?}
  where -->|isolated| pool{A free recorded slot?}
  where -->|in the primary checkout| sync[AGENTS.md's workspace section<br/>brought in step first]
  sync --> launch
  pool -->|yes| reuse[Reset it to the base<br/>on branch agent/id<br/>the target's furthest tip, local or as last fetched]
  pool -->|no| cut[git worktree add .worktrees/id<br/>and record that UZE made it]
  reuse --> setup[The project's setup command runs]
  cut --> setup
  setup --> launch[Started through its shim, by path<br/>every pane puts the shims first on PATH]
  launch --> name[uze agent work name type/subject<br/>or, still unnamed at the first commit,<br/>named from that commit's subject]
  name --> running[Running]
  running -->|continued in another harness| brief[A briefing kept in the agent's record<br/>given through the incoming harness's context channel<br/>on every launch until the agent's next commit]
  brief --> launch
  running --> evaluate{What Git says, each pass}
  evaluate -->|a dirty tree| uncommitted[Uncommitted]
  evaluate -->|agent gone, work left| shelved[Unfinished<br/>commits on its branch,<br/>the rest on refs/uze/shelf/id]
  evaluate -->|agent gone, nothing to deliver| closed[Closed]
  shelved --> free
  shelved -->|resumed| reuse
  closed --> free[Its slot is free:<br/>kept until it goes idle]
  uncommitted -->|it commits| ready
  evaluate -->|commits ahead, clean tree| ready[Ready]
  ready -->|the pane went quiet| refresh[refresh<br/>rebase onto the target's furthest tip]
  ready --> deliver([The operator delivers one task])
  deliver --> declared{A delivery declared?}
  declared -->|no| refused[Refused<br/>nothing written, still Ready]
  declared -->|yes| integrating[Integrating<br/>under the repository write lock]
  integrating --> already{Already in the target's tip?}
  already -->|squashed on the forge| integrated[Integrated]
  already -->|no| rebase{Rebase onto the tip}
  rebase -->|conflict, target untouched| conflicted[Conflicted<br/>the rebase stays paused in the checkout]
  rebase -->|clean| gate{The declared gate, on the rebased commits}
  gate -->|fails| failed[GateFailed]
  conflicted --> told[The agent is sent the project's instruction<br/>for the state it was left in, if one is declared]
  failed --> told
  gate -->|passes| completion{Where the project puts the work}
  completion -->|push| published[Published<br/>the branch pushed, no request yet]
  published --> told
  completion -->|merge| overlap{Files the target moved too?}
  overlap -->|yes| refused
  overlap -->|no| forward[Fast-forward the target]
  forward --> integrated
  integrated --> told
